# 06-10 Task 2: apps/desktop/build/ holds the COMMITTED macOS entitlement
# plists. The blanket `build/` rule above (meant for generated output) would
# otherwise silently untrack them, which would make the signed bundle depend
# on files no clone contains.
!apps/desktop/build/
# Owner-local operational helpers. `publish-signing-secrets.sh` reads a
# Developer ID .p12 passphrase and 1Password credentials at runtime; it holds
# no secrets itself, but this repository is headed for a public release and a
# stray `git add -A` should not publish a signing-secrets workflow.
tooling/local/
